= Party/Alliance logos

**All party/alliance logo's are custom made by Communist45, redesigned official party logos by Communist45 or are a direct import of the actual logo when available.**

SLFP: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sri_Lanka_Freedom_Party_election_symbol.png

UNP: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:United_National_Party_logo.png

TULF: https://kiruththiyam.blogspot.com/2010/03/tamil-united-liberation-front-election.html

CWC: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Ceylon_Workers%27_Congress.svg

ACTC: Modified https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_Ceylon_Tamil_Congress#/media/File:Bandera_All_Ceylon_Tamil_Congress.svg by adding its election symbol of the bicycle

CPSL: Modified https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:South_Asian_Communist_Banner.png

JVP: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Janatha_Vimukthi_Peramuna#/media/File:JVP_election_symbol.png

SLPP: https://dailynews.lk/2023/11/03/politics/207152/slpp-marks-seventh-anniversary-today/

SLMP: https://srilankamirror.com/news/sri-lanka-mahajana-party-to-support-ranil-in-presidential-race/

EROS: Custom made based of its election symbol, the backhoe.

LSSP: https://revolutionsnewsstand.com/2023/01/12/the-story-of-tea-srilanka-imperialism-and-the-lanka-sama-samaja-party-by-stanley-plastrik-sherman-stanley-from-new-international-vol-5-no-9-september-1939/

NSSP: Custom made by combining a trotskyite hammer & sickle with the NSSP election symbol, the table.

DPLF: Custom made based on the colours & design of the PLOTE and the DPLF election symbol, the anchor.

MEP: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahajana_Eksath_Peramuna#/media/File:Logo_of_the_Mahajana_Eksath_Peramuna.png

PFLT: https://crestresearch.ac.uk/comment/sri-lanka-mcdowell/

SLMC: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sri_Lanka_Muslim_Congress#/media/File:XG9DO4WR_SLMC.jpg

NPP: https://island.lk/has-compass-lost-direction-2/

UCPF: Based on the UCPF election symbol, the spade.

DUNF: https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&rct=j&q=&esrc=s&source=web&cd=&cad=rja&uact=8&ved=2ahUKEwi2sZDnhMWVAxXIbPUHHWHJO14Q6vUJegQIOxAA&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fdunf.lk%2F&usg=AOvVaw21lpPlBQF_KVWbVlI1aMRF&opi=89978449

ULPP: Custom made based on the ULPP election symbol, the aeroplane.

ITAK: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilankai_Tamil_Arasu_Kachchi#/media/File:Flag_of_the_Federal_Party_of_Sri_Lanka.svg

SLFSP: Custom made, the rays behind the hammer & sickle are based of the SLFSP election symbol, the sun.

NLF: Custom made, includes the NLF election symbol, the aeroplane.

LDP: Custom made, includes the LDP election symbol, the clock.

CLP: Custom made, includes the CLP sole MP's election symbol, the bicycle.

VLSSP: Custom made, no particular inspiration.

BBF: Custom made, includes the BBF election symbol, the butterfly.

SLNF: Custom made, includes the SLNF election symbol, the spoon.

SPFC: Custom made, includes the SPFC election symbol, the eye.

TRF: Custom made, no particular inspiration.

TSF: Custom made, no particular inspiration.

BSP-BLP: Custom made, no particular inspiration.

TELO: https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/TNA-support-for-UNP-TELO-insists-on-written-agreement-citing-demands/108-159234

PLOTE: https://www.facebook.com/PLOTE1/

EPRLF: https://lankafocus.org/பத்மநாபா-ஆவணங்கள்/

ENDLF: Custom made, no particular inspiration.

EPDP: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Eelam_People’s_Democratic_Party.svg

Governer-General: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor-General_of_Ceylon#/media/File:Flag_of_the_Governor-General_of_Ceylon_(1952–1972).svg

DTNA: Custom made, includes the DTNA election symbol, the lamp.

SB/SBMP: Custom made, includes the SB election symbol, the medallion.

TPNA: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tamil_People%27s_National_Alliance#/media/File:Logo_of_the_Tamil_People's_National_Alliance.png

MNA: Custom made, includes the MNA election symbol, the scales.

OPPP: Custom made, includes the OPPP election symbol, the flag. Also includes the Bodu Bola Sena logo dew to their support for the party.

SJB: Modified https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samagi_Jana_Balawegaya#/media/File:Logo_and_electoral_symbol_of_the_Samagi_Jana_Balawegaya.svg

SLPFA: Modified https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Election_Symbol_Sri_Lanka_Podujana_Peramuna_Sri_Lanka.png

NC: Custom made, includes the NC election symbol, the horse.

ACMC: https://manthri.lk/en/parties/all-ceylon-makkal-congress-acmc

UNF/UNFGG: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_National_Front_(Sri_Lanka)#/media/File:United_National_Front_logo.jpg

SLP: Custom made, includes the SLP election symbol, the kangaroo.

TMVP: Modified https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tamil_Makkal_Viduthalai_Pulikal#/media/File:Election_Symbol_Tamil_Makkal_Viduthalai_Pulikal_Sri_Lanka.jpg

TNPF: https://island.lk/tamil-parties-to-have-talks-on-making-new-constitution/

DNA: Modified https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Election_Symbol_Democratic_National_Alliance_Sri_Lanka.jpg

NDF: Modified https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Election_Symbol_Swan_Sri_Lanka.png & https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Election_Symbol_New_Democratic_Front_Sri_lanka.png

JHU/SH: Custom made, includes the JHU/SH election symbol, the conch shell.

UPFA: https://www.onlanka.com/news/upfa-wants-constitutional-and-electoral-reforms-in-one-go.html

TNA: Modified https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tamil_National_Alliance#/media/File:Logo_of_the_Tamil_National_Alliance.png

NUA: Custom made, includes the NUA election symbol, the flying pigeon.

PA: Custom made, includes the PA election symbol, the chair.

USA: Custom made, includes the USA election symbol, the clay lamp.

